  "question": {
    "text": "If the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has distinct real roots and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has only one real root, then"
  },
  "options": [
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": true
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    },
    {
      "text": "<math><mi>b</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>0</mn><mo>,</mo><mi></mi><mi>a</mi><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>0</mn></math>",
      "is_correct": false
    }
  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "Since the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has distinct real roots and <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mfenced close=\"|\" open=\"|\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> has only one real root<br />So, one root of the equation <math><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mi>a</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math>&nbsp;will be zero and the other root will be negative.<br />Hence,&nbsp;<math><mi>b</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>0</mn></math> and <math><mi>a</mi><mo>&#62;</mo><mn>0</mn></math><br /><img src=\"assets\\st0010_c1fcca187fbe.png\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width:3.59375in;height:1.59375in\" />"
  }
